scene play_bunker
note ab6: the bot plays E01_MQ01 from the live quest graph and the generated quest_goals table, no recording input; both players get the StrelokImmune Invulnerability effect (Unkillable+Unfocusable) and must stay above 50 hp
@D closeui
@D bot hpguard 100
@D god 1
@D bot immune on StrelokImmune 2000
@D bot hpmin reset
@C closeui
@C bot hpguard 100
@C god 1
@C bot immune on StrelokImmune 2000
@C time 12:00
@C closeui
@C bot hpmin reset
@C bot quest
@C bot play until=E01_MQ01_Bunker timeout=420
@C bot quest
@C bot hpmin 50
@D bot hpmin 50
@C bot immune
@D bot immune
